[{"title":"余计院父子以我乏酒连以一壶为饷","author":"韩淲","text":"冷坐楼窗欲雪天，空搔华发泥尘编。\n不嫌酒尽西湖上，安得诗如南涧边。\n剥啄故人还饷我，开尝馀味信能贤。\n公家父子何多事，今日碧香犹卓然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26835,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酒尽","author":"韩淲","text":"连宵风月颇堪看，酒尽端怜赏咏难。\n岂但衔头沽苦贵，更缘秫早酿多酸。\n萧萧陶径柳将落，渺渺吴江枫欲丹。\n安得酒船数百斛，拍浮长遣一生欢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26836,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访吴推官津亭因唤船小酌而归","author":"韩淲","text":"沿洄舣泊更跻攀，好事来寻小艇閒。\n却忆武昌游赤壁，可怜姑熟醉青山。\n岸凉崦霭知空谷，水远汀沙见浅湾。\n惜别且同幽兴熟，鳣鱼泼泼鸟关关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26837,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昌甫分寄瓢泉继而辛卿遗一壶来以诗为谢","author":"韩淲","text":"章泉分饷瓢泉酒，已洗牢愁万马空。\n重拜书题如夏日，便开瓮盎泻春风。\n时闻水石云山主，世数文章翰墨功。\n且道岁寒梅雪好，僧窗閒有几人同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26838,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饮横碧轩","author":"韩淲","text":"僧舍颓檐屋一间，吕曾南渡此看山。\n风光流转人虽远，诗句磨镌景自閒。\n好事肯同携酒至，青春又见隔年还。\n坐中野老醺然醉，指点梅花亦可攀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26839,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢户曹载酒见访","author":"韩淲","text":"闭閤烧香正寂寥，忽看结客过衡茅。\n溪山有味真堪乐，松竹无心肯绝交。\n老树枕流倾社瓮，凉风吹月上山殽。\n浮梁饮散各归去，夜静水明摇柳梢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26840,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喻伯经推官约施翔甫父子载酒涧上 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"丽泽同窗不一人，是时文物动簪绅。\n年来此话谁能问，老去知君我独亲。\n天下传闻难见道，世间来往易知津。\n持醪野路江梅底，后会相逢意转真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26841,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喻伯经推官约施翔甫父子载酒涧上 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"岁晚寻梅又一年，南山岩下涧溪边。\n雪残古路初何似，诗到前村更隐然。\n邂逅襟期元拔俗，从容宦达自登仙。\n奉亲携幼人之乐，赢得朋来棹酒船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26842,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留客煮饼因过山寺煎茶","author":"韩淲","text":"旋扫荒凉喜客来，胡床随处坐徘徊。\n野亭汤饼谈方透，山寺茶香望转开。\n风近凛秋多落叶，雨收残照少飞埃。\n大都识赏非难事，莫被旁人富贵催。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26843,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"方斋子潜留瀹茗 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"东吴南楚江湖外，城郭方斋尚得朋。\n意象古人无索寞，谭锋尔汝有凭陵。\n花开薝卜疑非俗，林拥旃檀祗欠僧。\n梅雨未收吾欲醉，山桥归路发鬅鬙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26844,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"方斋子潜留瀹茗 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"蕙亩分青长复低，菊梅连绿密仍稀。\n墙阴未午风声急，窗外从朝雨力微。\n坐待酒杯来肃肃，案翻书册净晖晖。\n几年来往徒多感，今是那知较昨非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26845,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"叶侍郎寄乌石茶昌甫诗谢之次韵同赋","author":"韩淲","text":"瓶茶远自水心寄，缄诗又谢章泉分。\n拣芽为赠信灵物，回味有功非世勋。\n降伏睡魔庶永日，不居酒圣须乘云。\n何时幽讨共仰止，乌石冈头煮此云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26846,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"弈棋","author":"韩淲","text":"水竹光中戏弈棋，棋中妙处有谁知。\n对人不到一盘满，信手拈来几著奇。\n活法要须能自悟，危机何用苦寻思。\n此心虚静元无物，莫使颠冥胜负时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26847,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新火","author":"韩淲","text":"香浮椽烛散新烟，阊阖沉沉辇路边。\n宝蜡分擎初拜赐，锦衣飞步竞传宣。\n柳阴未晓明妆镜，花气笼晴趁卷帘。\n莫怪荒凉问榆火，午炊犹待死灰然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26848,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蕨菜","author":"韩淲","text":"春华满眼倦寻诗，蕨菜才来又赋之。\n雷雨动山应偪塞，风云垂地正奔驰。\n僧盘何苦分荤素，鼎食那能问瘠肥。\n珍重方斋家送似，为加餐饭亦何其。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26849,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢人遗藷","author":"韩淲","text":"风起炉寒鬻未成，儿惊门底有人声。\n乃携藷药来相馈，尚带泥沙便可烹。\n夷以采薇清易足，屈于餐菊恨难平。\n老身得此浑无事，捧腹摩挲且莫鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26850,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜见莼丝","author":"韩淲","text":"一杯浊酒下莼丝，不负东吴薄宦期。\n安得林逋同隐约，尚凭张翰写心思。\n人间美恶吾能会，物外清閒世莫知。\n更待西风小摇落，鲈羹盐豉转相宜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26851,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送爆竹潘舍人","author":"韩淲","text":"使者归来守岁除，嘉殽应笑去年无。\n锦囊自是诗无敌，宝带还看骑甚都。\n想见颂花方列炬，故将爆竹伴屠苏。\n祝公茂介春祺去，明日朝元拱御炉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26852,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"潘舍人重打带","author":"韩淲","text":"使回挥橐试从容，诗在腰围瘦减中。\n金重内分知带赤，花明殿后映鞓红。\n闻呼巧匠重陶写，好称朝章答化工。\n更待狨鞯印如斗，转庵元是有家风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26853,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴澧州兵部挽诗","author":"韩淲","text":"桂籍传芳两弟兄，才华奕奕尽专城。\n独跻郎省享高寿，复处祠庭全令名。\n遗爱梁山初趣召，承恩澧浦晚增荣。\n如今仁义乡前路，忍送灵车薤露声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26854,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄壶隐挽诗","author":"韩淲","text":"国朝人物盛江西，欧晏曾王世所知。\n剩喜年来说壶隐，还看身后纪丰碑。\n路遥莫致生刍奠，心折聊成薤露词。\n高蹈如斯天必假，彬彬子舍见孙枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26855,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"周南仲正字挽诗","author":"韩淲","text":"姑苏台下同杯酒，一旦相从情转亲。\n才屈自应无近用，时升谁不有通津。\n避名苦节乾坤大，务道圆机岁月新。\n我亦推藏山涧曲，细思馀论忍沾巾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26856,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"叶和剂挽诗","author":"韩淲","text":"守道安恬誉翕然，晚登朝路合腾骞。\n身劳援溺尝贻疾，梦兆囹空信不冤。\n倾盖方欣同药藏，挂冠谓可乐丘园。\n愁闻薤露闽山远，馀庆他年属后昆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26857,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽余伯玉药局诗","author":"韩淲","text":"抵掌从容慨且悲，晚年风度喜论诗。\n贤关鼓箧文尤擅，德里垂车志岂违。\n筑室高门如昨日，开筵投辖已前时。\n寿登八秩流芳裔，松柏佳城画翣吹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26858,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄靖州挽诗","author":"韩淲","text":"两把州符身已老，壮年崛起计偕时。\n藏书漫与诗千首，种秫閒寻酒一卮。\n北客到今真可数，南人视彼尚何知。\n鹤山父子成丘陇，泪洒溪风读圹碑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26859,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄子耕监丞挽诗","author":"韩淲","text":"籍籍夷陵郭白云，紫阳犹足重斯文。\n当年臭味传天壤，绝代声华隔世氛。\n邂逅月边兰桨驻，从容日下竹符分。\n伤哉逝矣空遗藁，双井风高信不群。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26860,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"哭徐子融","author":"韩淲","text":"胆气粗而硬脊梁，茅斋寂寞未云荒。\n自知友道无同异，共仰师门有在亡。\n遣世尚能生卜地，安时应许老耕桑。\n一琴一剑山枫外，云影吹空白月光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26861,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"哭徐大彦章","author":"韩淲","text":"翻阅前言力著书，暮年尤惜日之馀。\n倦从科第于荣宦，静养声明只燕居。\n落落溪山空尔许，悠悠天地复何如。\n伤嗟平昔琴尊地，常似亲承教载初。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26862,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"明皇揽镜而言吾虽瘠天下肥矣","author":"韩淲","text":"引镜吾虽瘠，韩休谏疏多。\n君心在天下，欢乐竟如何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26863,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高祖令李密迎见秦王李密不敢仰视","author":"韩淲","text":"甲马幽州路，英雄不自量。\n凯歌迎劳处，方识小秦王。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26864,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霍光夜召符玺郎","author":"韩淲","text":"拥昭初辅政，汉室大将军。\n符玺郎能尔，丹青见不群。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26865,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王景略对桓温扪虱而谈当世之务","author":"韩淲","text":"本谓温犹好，而能北伐功。\n自从扪虱后，绝意过江东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26866,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冯媛当熊","author":"韩淲","text":"槛外当熊立，人情见亦惊。\n翩翩后宫女，冯媛独驰声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26867,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨妃剪发","author":"韩淲","text":"剪发能留宠，君王不自持。\n当年无入奏，宁到马嵬时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26868,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南山","author":"韩淲","text":"霏霏南山来，此意足怡悦。\n昏旦气候间，棂疏互明灭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26869,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"思颍堂","author":"韩淲","text":"乡庐暗边尘，时移而事变。\n结屋漫逍遥，可想不可见。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26870,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"情话堂","author":"韩淲","text":"赵记发旧观，俞孙新作堂。\n是岂无他人，亲戚意差长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26871,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有竹堂","author":"韩淲","text":"坡翁一转语，不但为竹设。\n俗子尘污人，夏簟落苍雪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26872,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跨鹤台","author":"韩淲","text":"道人白鹤庵，绝顶似仙家。\n寻幽得台城，杳杳入青霞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26873,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南台","author":"韩淲","text":"木老地平静，直北万家城。\n小立兴怀处，凭高眼更明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26874,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"禅月台","author":"韩淲","text":"此台已芜没，禅月彼一时。\n得句僧窗下，空留洗墨池。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26875,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题朱直学竹轩","author":"韩淲","text":"裂石作翠竹，秋风生晚凉。\n政须人啸咏，应记我行藏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26876,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"横碧轩","author":"韩淲","text":"文清来此地，留下横碧轩。\n寂寂今无主，空山起夕烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26877,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题贯时轩","author":"韩淲","text":"柯叶贯四时，不为寒暑变。\n理事俱到处，因之亦可见。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26878,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无尽藏","author":"韩淲","text":"善继人之志，肯堂思其艰。\n此意自无尽，风月敬亭山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26879,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小集清晖阁因唤渡把酒昌甫倏至","author":"韩淲","text":"小醉清晖阁，横江更一杯。\n远山寒日晚，诗老忽然来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26880,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"樗亭","author":"韩淲","text":"筑亭以樗名，平生无宦情。\n寥寥千载人，感慨闻风声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26881,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"如庵","author":"韩淲","text":"静深堂奥间，真如公所庵。\n谁谓平生心，可以禅境参。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26882,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山简习池游诗","author":"韩淲","text":"拍手儿童笑，山公倒接䍦。\n举鞭无限意，今古少人知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26883,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题华严境","author":"韩淲","text":"游目贝叶书，究竟华严境。\n当年寓名心，观者要深省。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26884,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桃源山道者小庵","author":"韩淲","text":"天寒山气黄，日暮竹色碧。\n住庵人勿惊，此景有此客。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26885,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"葛溪","author":"韩淲","text":"流传葛仙翁，此溪尝化龙。\n抱朴今何在，閒来问古踪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26886,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南坡","author":"韩淲","text":"空青老仙伯，有子爱溪山。\n谁信南坡路，依依泉石间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26887,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蒙泉","author":"韩淲","text":"一泓泉水古，依旧浸岩边。\n太史晁鸡肋，遗吟尚可传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26888,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟入灵岩山下访古","author":"韩淲","text":"燕麦摇晴日，青山两岸横。\n吴其为沼矣，倾酒任船行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26889,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十七日过潭守听松","author":"韩淲","text":"推窗万松林，杂沓且修整。\n何须抚盘桓，姑以集幽听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26890,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四月二日 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"檐浅侵林绿，窗虚剩蕊红。\n试茶催鼎实，纵酒失杯空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26891,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四月二日 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"易觉春风老，偏知夏日长。\n四山新笋出，一涧野花香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26892,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四月二日 其三","author":"韩淲","text":"昼永卷书困，时閒挈杖清。\n草虫空踯躅，巢燕费经营。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26893,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四月二日 其四","author":"韩淲","text":"间或僧人到，閒常羽客过。\n启玄疑恍惚，谈妙欲云何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26894,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四月二日 其五","author":"韩淲","text":"樵斧通深密，渔竿接混茫。\n风波非地险，荆棘乃天荒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26895,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"爆竹","author":"韩淲","text":"爆竹烧残岁，家家把一杯。\n西湖元自好，只是欠徘徊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26896,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"倚瑟","author":"韩淲","text":"倚瑟从嫔御，人生实少欢。\n南山空斮絮，此道是邯郸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26897,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"韩淲","text":"连窗风撼山，引酒灯照坐。\n逍遥入庄吟，憔悴失楚些。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26898,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王丞留饮 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"寻梅闲唤酒，邀友漫题诗。\n酒美君方醉，诗成我未奇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26899,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王丞留饮 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"钟声来远寺，暝色起前溪。\n霜夜断鸿急，风庭落叶知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26900,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访滕贤良邂逅周察推同饮池上","author":"韩淲","text":"春风杂花池，宾主两相视。\n落日忽已晴，洗盏可无醉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26901,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"招余子任过成季家","author":"韩淲","text":"只道沙坑近，招之阿那边。\n不知风雨夕，能过小溪船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26902,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵周倅送郡酝 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"闻道菖蒲节，龙舟一一修。\n雨凉虽少憩，郡圃不妨游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26903,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵周倅送郡酝 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"坐有严陵守，新持使节长。\n真成三学士，意象好持觞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26904,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题隆中图","author":"韩淲","text":"何意求闻达，偶逢刘豫州。\n隆中三顾处，抱膝也风流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26905,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵潘舍人画轴 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"风霜归老干，岁月长枝柯。\n矗矗荒村外，人人占落坡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26906,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵潘舍人画轴 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"寻诗小醉时，不许老农知。\n叶叶泛轻舠，试渡野水陂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26907,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵潘舍人画轴 其三","author":"韩淲","text":"突兀是茅屋，摇兀是土桥。\n看山看水去，忘饥付木瓢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26908,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵潘舍人画轴 其四","author":"韩淲","text":"荒虚成莽荡，幽远似模糊。\n便做山中客，能题一字无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26909,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵子颜 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"乐道匪时趋，山间得自如。\n老来情味别，冬日且闲居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":26910,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]